</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername>permutation</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para><ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1Permutation" kindref="compound">Permutation</ref> defining the mapping from old cell indices to new cell indices.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="pre"><para><computeroutput>permutation</computeroutput> is a valid permutation over the cells represented by <computeroutput>field</computeroutput>.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="post"><para>Each field value remains associated with the same cell as before the permutation was applied. </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
