    <briefdescription>
<para>Applies cell permutations to mesh and cell-associated data. </para>
    </briefdescription>
    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classNeoFOAM_1_1PermutationApplicator" kindref="compound">PermutationApplicator</ref> applies a valid cell permutation to <ref refid="namespaceNeoN" kindref="compound">NeoN</ref> mesh data while preserving the consistency of cell-associated data and references.</para>
<para>A cell permutation has two distinct effects:</para>
<para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>Cell-associated data, such as cell fields and cell geometry, is reordered according to the permutation.</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>Cell references stored in mesh connectivity, such as face owner and neighbor indices, are remapped according to the permutation.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
<para>The aplicator does not:<itemizedlist>
<listitem><para>compute permutations</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>modify permutation objects</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>select ordering algorithms</para>
</listitem><listitem><para>perform implicit host/device data transfers </para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
    </detaileddescription>
